WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:06.269
Code Crackers is a team word game for four to eight players, with a bit of spy movie in it.

2
00:00:06.969 --> 00:00:12.387
Each team has four secret words, numbered one to four, and you can only see your own.

3
00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:18.796
On your turn, one person from the team, the encryptor, gets a secret code, like three, one, four.

4
00:00:19.496 --> 00:00:26.111
They write one clue for each digit, pointing at that numbered word, and their teammates have to work out the code.

5
00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:30.914
From the second round on, the other team gets to try and intercept it too.

6
00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:38.750
A wrong guess from your own team earns a black token. A correct interception earns the interceptors a white one.

7
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:44.802
Two of either decides the game, so it's about being clear to your friends and confusing to your enemies.

8
00:00:45.502 --> 00:00:50.753
Every clue ever given stays visible, so the history is your best weapon. Study it.

9
00:00:50.903 --> 00:00:54.331
And vary your style, or your old clues will give you away.
